Subject: [PATCH] rubyx: camera: Implement torch light control

* Took reference from: https://github.com/PixelOS-Devices/android_device_motorola_cancunf/commit/2c27f45dc79fe6c0d00ff01f2d55a42f090a744e

Signed-off-by: Aeron-Aeron <aeronrules2@gmail.com>
Signed-off-by: rajdeep-3305 <rajdeepbiswas3305@gmail.com>
---
